---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';
import ExternalBrandMark from '../common/ExternalBrandMark';
import { VANILLA_SD_LORA_MECHANISM as facts } from '../../data/vanillaSdLoraMechanism';
import OpenEvoVanillaSdLoraSlide from './OpenEvoVanillaSdLoraSlide.astro';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path: string) => localePath(locale, path);
const gdrHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/gdr-directapply/');
const gatedDeltaHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/gated-delta-sd-lora/');
const q17Href = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/q17-directapply-frontier/');
const mechanismHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/mechanism-1-0/');
const helps = zh ? [
  '基础模型本身保持不动。',
  '以前学到的参数方向不会被下一轮直接改写。',
  '新的成功经验还能学出一个新方向。',
  '每轮还能带回最多 64 条旧经验，避免只看眼前这一轮。',
] : [
  'The base model avoids full-parameter updates.',
  'Earlier learned directions are not directly overwritten.',
  'New successful experience can add a new parameter direction.',
  'Bounded replay keeps some earlier experience visible to the optimizer.',
];
const risks = zh ? [
  '只有完整成功会直接训练参数，所以一直失败的难题可能长期没有训练信号。',
  '旧经验最多只保留一小部分，不是完整历史。',
  '旧方向本身不动，但它们的权重 α 还会重调，所以实际影响仍会变化。',
  '训练损失（loss）下降、学到更多方向，也不保证 WebShop 分数会一直上涨。',
] : [
  'Direct supervision comes only from exact success, so hard tasks may remain unseen by the trainer.',
  'Replay is bounded rather than a complete history.',
  'Old directions freeze, but α can still change their behavioral contribution.',
  'Lower loss and more components do not guarantee monotonic WebShop improvement.',
];

---
<article class="sdlora" data-copy-review data-testid="vanilla-sd-lora-mechanism" data-reader-page="research-explainer" data-ui-audit="contrast layout">
  <section class="sdlora-intro" data-reader-primary aria-labelledby="sdlora-intro-title">
    <h1 id="sdlora-intro-title">{t('SD-LoRA：成功轨迹怎样变成候选 LoRA 参数', 'SD-LoRA: how successful traces become a candidate LoRA update')}</h1>
    <p class="sdlora-intro__lede">{t(
      'LoRA 是冻结基础模型、只训练一小组适配参数的方法。这里的 SD-LoRA 从 WebShop（网页购物任务）的成功轨迹中选训练数据：每个任务只取最早一条通过全部检查的成功，在两批任务之间训练出一份候选 LoRA 参数。',
      'LoRA freezes the base model and trains a small adapter. Here, SD-LoRA selects training data from successful WebShop traces: for each task it keeps the earliest fully checked success, then trains a candidate LoRA update between task batches.'
    )}</p>
    <ol class="sdlora-intro__steps" aria-label={t('成功轨迹到下一轮参数的三步', 'Three steps from successful traces to next-round parameters')}>
      <li><span>1</span><strong>{t('筛选成功轨迹', 'Select successful traces')}</strong><p>{t('每个任务只留最早一条通过全部检查的成功。', 'Keep the earliest fully checked success for each task.')}</p></li>
      <li><span>2</span><strong>{t('训练候选参数', 'Train candidate parameters')}</strong><p>{t('SD-LoRA 用这些成功轨迹和有限旧经验训练一份新候选。', 'SD-LoRA trains a new candidate from those successes and bounded old experience.')}</p></li>
      <li><span>3</span><strong>{t('再决定是否采用', 'Then decide whether to adopt it')}</strong><p>{t('训练完成不等于下一轮已经使用；采用是后续的独立决定。', 'Training completion does not mean the next round already uses it; adoption is a separate decision.')}</p></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="sdlora-intro__boundary"><strong>{t('候选参数不等于能力一定提升。', 'Candidate parameters do not imply guaranteed capability gains.')}</strong> {t('本实现每轮最多回放 64 条旧经验，因此不是原论文“不回放旧经验”（rehearsal-free）的训练协议；以前学到的参数方向保持不动，也不保证 WebShop 分数会持续上涨。', 'This implementation replays up to 64 old examples per round, so it is not the paper’s rehearsal-free protocol; keeping earlier parameter directions fixed still does not guarantee that WebShop scores keep rising.')}</p>
  </section>

  <details class="sdlora__section sdlora__section--primer" id="what-is-sd-lora">
    <summary>{t('普通 LoRA 与 SD-LoRA 的参数区别', 'Parameter difference between ordinary LoRA and SD-LoRA')}</summary>
    <p>{t(
      '普通 LoRA 冻结基础模型，只学习一个低秩参数更新。SD-LoRA 全名是 Scalable Decoupled LoRA；它把累计更新拆成多个方向 D 和对应系数 α，让旧方向保留，同时继续学习新方向。',
      'Ordinary LoRA freezes the base model and learns one low-rank parameter update. SD-LoRA stands for Scalable Decoupled LoRA; it represents the accumulated update as directions D with coefficients α, preserving earlier directions while learning new ones.'
    )}</p>
    <div class="sdlora-compare-wrap" role="region" aria-label={t('普通 LoRA 与 SD-LoRA 对比', 'Ordinary LoRA versus SD-LoRA comparison')} tabindex="0">
      <table class="sdlora-compare-table">
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">{t('维度', 'Dimension')}</th><th scope="col">{t('普通 LoRA', 'Ordinary LoRA')}</th><th scope="col">SD-LoRA</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">{t('参数形式', 'Parameter form')}</th><td><code>ΔW = BA</code></td><td><code>ΔWₜ = Σ αᵢDᵢ</code></td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">{t('旧方向', 'Earlier directions')}</th><td>{t('没有把旧方向单独冻结成历史角色', 'not preserved as separate frozen historical directions')}</td><td>{t('旧 D 保持不动', 'earlier D stay fixed')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">{t('新一轮学习', 'New-round learning')}</th><td>{t('学习新的低秩 A / B', 'learn new low-rank A / B')}</td><td>{t('学一个新 Dₜ，并重调所有 α', 'learn one new Dₜ and rebalance all α')}</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="sdlora-note"><strong>{t('本页把没有加入后续加速变体的当前基线称为 “Vanilla SD-LoRA”。', 'This page calls the current baseline “Vanilla SD-LoRA.”')}</strong> {t('它仍然使用 SD-LoRA 的方向 / 幅度分解；“Vanilla” 只用来和后续 SD-LoRA 变体区分。', 'It still uses SD-LoRA’s direction/magnitude decomposition; “Vanilla” only distinguishes this baseline from later SD-LoRA variants.')}</p>
    <p class="sdlora-caveat">{t('ICLR 2025 的原始 SD-LoRA 论文研究 class-incremental vision continual learning，并强调 rehearsal-free；我们当前的语言 Agent / WebShop 适配会带回最多 64 条旧经验，因此 paper_equivalent=false、rehearsal_free=false。这里借用核心的方向 / 幅度分解思想，不是逐项复刻论文实验。', 'The original ICLR 2025 SD-LoRA paper studies class-incremental vision continual learning and emphasizes rehearsal-free training. Our language-agent / WebShop adaptation replays up to 64 old examples, so paper_equivalent=false and rehearsal_free=false. We reuse the core direction/magnitude decomposition rather than reproducing the paper protocol item for item.')}</p>
  </details>

  <OpenEvoVanillaSdLoraSlide locale={locale} />
  <section class="sdlora__section" id="round-inputs" aria-labelledby="round-inputs-title">
    <h2 id="round-inputs-title">{t('一轮开始前，模型带着什么？', 'What does the model carry into a round?')}</h2>
    <p class="sdlora-round-context">{t('这一步属于持续学习阶段。前一阶段先由 Qwen 完成 WebShop 任务，MiniMax 只在任务结束后回看已保存轨迹；持续学习还可能更新文字记忆（Text Memory）、可复用技能（Skill Bundle）和全局行为规则（Agent System）。这些对象会影响下一轮，但本页只继续追踪 SD-LoRA 参数怎样训练和采用。', 'This belongs to the continual-learning stage. Qwen first completes the WebShop task and MiniMax reviews the saved trace only after the task ends. Continual learning may also update written memory (Text Memory), reusable skills (Skill Bundle), and global behavior rules (Agent System). Those states can affect the next round, but this page continues to track only how SD-LoRA parameters are trained and adopted.')}</p>
    <div class="sdlora-two-col">
      <div data-ui-audit-item>
        <h3>{t('会直接影响这 128 次尝试的东西', 'What directly shapes these 128 attempts')}</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>{t('基础模型参数保持不动。', 'The base-model parameters stay fixed.')}</li>
          <li>{t('加载上一轮已经选定的累计 SD-LoRA。', 'Load the cumulative SD-LoRA selected after the prior round.')}</li>
          <li>Text Memory / Skill Bundle / Agent System — {t('Text Memory 保存文字经验，Skill Bundle 提供可复用技能，Agent System 给出全局行为规则；它们会改变模型看到的上下文或行为，但 SD-LoRA 训练器不会把它们当成参数来更新。', 'Text Memory stores written experience, Skill Bundle provides reusable skills, and Agent System supplies global behavior rules; they can change the model’s context or behavior, but the SD-LoRA trainer does not update them as model parameters.')}</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div data-ui-audit-item>
        <h3>{t('这一轮要做什么', 'What happens this round')}</h3>
        <p><strong>{t(`一共 ${facts.round.rolloutCount} 次：${facts.round.taskCount} 个任务，每个试 ${facts.round.rolloutsPerTask} 次`, `${facts.round.rolloutCount} attempts total: ${facts.round.taskCount} tasks × ${facts.round.rolloutsPerTask}`)}</strong></p>
        <p>{t('每次尝试都会留下动作、模型原始输出、最终得分、有没有完整成功，以及解析失败、修复和无效运行等错误信息。代码里把一次完整尝试叫 rollout。', 'Each attempt records the actions, raw model output, final score, whether it fully succeeded, and parser/repair/invalid-run diagnostics. The code calls one complete attempt a rollout.')}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="sdlora__section" id="training-data" aria-labelledby="training-data-title">
    <h2 id="training-data-title">{t('128 次尝试里，哪些会进入参数训练？', 'Which of the 128 attempts enter parameter training?')}</h2>
    <div class="sdlora-filter" data-ui-audit="contrast layout">
      <div class="sdlora-filter__all" data-ui-audit-item>
        <small>{facts.round.rolloutCount} {t('次任务尝试', 'task attempts')}</small>
        <strong>{t('全部留下，方便看这一轮发生了什么', 'Keep all of them to understand what happened this round')}</strong>
        <p>{t('失败、部分成功、修复过的输出和无效运行不会直接训练参数，但能帮助解释这一轮分数为什么变化。', 'Failures, partial successes, repaired outputs, and invalid runs do not directly train the parameters, but they help explain why the round score moved.')}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sdlora-filter__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
      <div class="sdlora-filter__train" data-ui-audit-item>
        <small>{t('进入参数训练', 'Used for parameter training')}</small>
        <strong>{t('每个任务只取最早一条通过全部检查的成功', 'Use the earliest fully checked success per task')}</strong>
        <p>{t('它必须完整成功，任务身份和轨迹都完整，而且没有解析失败、修复、工程无效或运行错误。内部记录把这种样本叫 clean exact success。', 'It must fully succeed with a valid task identity and complete trace, and have no parser failure, repair, engineering-invalid state, or runtime error. Internal records call this a clean exact success.')}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="sdlora-note">{t(
      `一个成功任务会把整条 ${facts.selection.traceStepsMin}–${facts.selection.traceStepsMax} 步轨迹留下，再拆成每一步的训练样本；这一轮最多 ${facts.selection.maxTraceExamples} 个轨迹样本，配置上限 ${facts.selection.maxRecords}。过去所有任务尝试不会整批混进来；跨轮只通过上一版累计 LoRA 保存的最多 ${facts.trainer.replayCapacity} 条旧经验回放。`,
      `A successful task keeps its full ${facts.selection.traceStepsMin}–${facts.selection.traceStepsMax}-step trajectory and is then split into step-level assistant targets. The current round is bounded at ${facts.selection.maxTraceExamples} trace examples, below the configured maximum of ${facts.selection.maxRecords}. The round dataset does not concatenate raw rollouts from earlier rounds; cross-round examples enter through bounded replay carried by the prior adapter.`
    )}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="sdlora__section" id="inside-update" aria-labelledby="inside-update-title">
    <h2 id="inside-update-title">{t('SD-LoRA 怎样更新参数？', 'How does SD-LoRA update the parameters?')}</h2>
    <ol class="sdlora-detail-steps">
      <li data-ui-audit-item><span>1</span><div><strong>{t('把本轮成功轨迹拆成训练样本', 'Turn this round’s successful traces into training examples')}</strong><p>{t('把成功轨迹里的每一步转成一个 chat/tool 样本，只对模型应该回答的部分计算训练损失（loss）。', 'Turn each successful step into a chat/tool example and compute training loss only on the model’s answer tokens.')}</p></div></li>
      <li data-ui-audit-item><span>2</span><div><strong>{t('再加入最多 64 条旧经验', 'Add up to 64 old examples')}</strong><p>{t(`上一轮会保存最多 ${facts.trainer.replayCapacity} 条旧经验；有历史数据时，训练器抽一部分旧经验，和本轮成功样本一起训练。`, `The previous round keeps up to ${facts.trainer.replayCapacity} old examples; when history exists, the trainer samples some of them and trains on them alongside this round’s successful examples.`)}</p></div></li>
      <li data-ui-audit-item><span>3</span><div><strong>{t('基础模型和旧方向都不动', 'Keep the base model and old directions fixed')}</strong><p>{t('W₀ 不训练，过去方向的 A/B 也不再更新。会更新的是本轮新方向 Aₜ/Bₜ，以及控制每个方向影响大小的系数 α。', 'W₀ and the prior directions’ A/B factors stay fixed. The trainable pieces are this round’s new Aₜ/Bₜ direction and the α coefficients that control how much each direction matters.')}</p></div></li>
      <li data-ui-audit-item><span>4</span><div><strong>{t('学一个新方向，同时重调每个方向的影响大小', 'Learn one new direction and rebalance how much every direction matters')}</strong><p>{t(`新方向的学习率是 ${facts.trainer.learningRate}；控制各方向影响大小的 α 用独立学习率 ${facts.trainer.coefficientLearningRate}。所以旧方向本身虽然不变，它们在最终 LoRA 里占多大作用仍会变化。`, `The new direction uses learning rate ${facts.trainer.learningRate}; α, which controls each direction’s influence, uses a separate ${facts.trainer.coefficientLearningRate}. Old directions stay fixed, but how much they contribute to the final LoRA can still change.`)}</p></div></li>
      <li data-ui-audit-item><span>5</span><div><strong>{t('最后把所有方向合成一份累计 LoRA', 'Finally combine all directions into one cumulative LoRA')}</strong><p>{t('训练后先把新方向 BₜAₜ 归一化，原来的大小记进 αₜ；再把所有方向合成一份兼容 PEFT 的累计 LoRA。', 'After training, normalize the new BₜAₜ direction and absorb its original magnitude into αₜ, then combine all directions into one PEFT-compatible cumulative LoRA.')}</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="sdlora__section" id="round-boundary" aria-labelledby="round-boundary-title">
    <h2 id="round-boundary-title">{t('训练结束后，下一轮到底用新参数还是旧参数？', 'After training, does the next round use the new or old parameters?')}</h2>
    <div class="sdlora-boundary" data-ui-audit="contrast layout">
      <div data-ui-audit-item>
        <small>{t('SD-LoRA 训练到这里结束', 'SD-LoRA training ends here')}</small>
        <strong>{t('先得到一份候选 LoRA', 'First produce a candidate LoRA')}</strong>
        <p>{t('这份新 LoRA 已经训练出来了，也带着有限旧经验，但它还不一定会被下一轮使用。', 'The new LoRA has been trained and carries a bounded set of old examples, but the next round has not necessarily adopted it yet.')}</p>
      </div>
      <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <div data-ui-audit-item>
        <small>{t('接下来才决定要不要用它', 'Then decide whether to use it')}</small>
        <strong>{t('当前：检查通过就采用；历史：先小测再选', 'Current: adopt after checks; historical: probe before choosing')}</strong>
        <p>{t('当前做法叫 DirectApply：工程和数据检查通过后，下一轮直接用新候选。历史本地 GDR-v1 会先用 16 个任务小测，再决定用新参数还是继续旧参数。', 'The current rule is called DirectApply: after engineering and data checks pass, the next round uses the new candidate. Historical local GDR-v1 first probes 16 tasks, then chooses the new or old parameters.')}</p>
      </div>
      <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <div data-ui-audit-item>
        <small>{t('下一轮', 'Next round')}</small>
        <strong>{t('用选定的参数继续跑', 'Run the next round with the selected parameters')}</strong>
        <p>{t('再做下一批任务，新的成功和失败又会变成下一轮证据。', 'Run the next batch of tasks; the new successes and failures become evidence for the following round.')}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="sdlora-note">{t('LoRA 训练完成和下一轮采用它是两件事：历史本地 GDR-v1 一共训练出 44 个候选，最后只有 7 个进入下一轮模型。', 'Training a LoRA candidate and adopting it for the next round are separate events. Historical local GDR-v1 trained 44 candidates, but only 7 entered the next-round model state.')}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="sdlora__section" id="mechanism-risks" aria-labelledby="mechanism-risks-title">
    <h2 id="mechanism-risks-title">{t('旧方向没被重写，也不代表能力会一直变好', 'Keeping old directions fixed does not guarantee capability keeps improving')}</h2>
    <div class="sdlora-two-col sdlora-two-col--evidence">
      <div data-ui-audit-item><h3>{t('它想保护什么', 'What this design tries to protect')}</h3><ul>{helps.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></div>
      <div data-ui-audit-item><h3>{t('还可能出什么问题', 'What can still go wrong')}</h3><ul>{risks.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul><p><strong>{t('这些是接下来要测的风险，目前还不能说它们就是已经发生的故障原因。', 'These are risks to test next; we cannot yet claim they are the causes of observed failures.')}</strong></p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="sdlora-caveat">{t('某一轮分数下降，不等于这次参数更新让模型整体变差：不同轮抽到的 WebShop 任务并不一样。2026-09-11 的固定同题诊断已经看到，抽题差异会把单轮回撤看起来放大。', 'A lower score in one round does not by itself mean the parameter update made the model globally worse: different rounds sample different WebShop tasks. The 2026-09-11 same-task diagnostic showed that task sampling can make a one-round drop look larger than it is.')}</p>
  </section>

  <details class="sdlora__details">
    <summary>{t('当前 Q17 / OpenEvo 实现参数与精确边界', 'Current Q17 / OpenEvo configuration and exact boundaries')}</summary>
    <dl class="sdlora-config">
      <div><dt>rank</dt><dd>{facts.trainer.rank}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>direction lr</dt><dd>{facts.trainer.learningRate}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>coefficient lr</dt><dd>{facts.trainer.coefficientLearningRate}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>epochs</dt><dd>{facts.trainer.epochs}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>replay capacity</dt><dd>{facts.trainer.replayCapacity}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>max length</dt><dd>{facts.trainer.maxLength}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>dtype</dt><dd>{facts.trainer.dtype}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>seed</dt><dd>{facts.trainer.seed}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>effective-rank limit</dt><dd>{facts.state.effectiveRankLimit}</dd></div>
      <div class="wide"><dt>target modules</dt><dd>{facts.trainer.targetModules.join(' · ')}</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p>{t(`当前语言 Agent 适配明确标记 paper_equivalent=false、rehearsal_free=false、routing_mode=single_cumulative_adapter、retention_strategy=bounded_trajectory_replay。每个 component 的 rank 是 ${facts.trainer.rank}，所以累计 effective rank 随 component 数增长；当前 Qwen3 路线的上限是 ${facts.state.effectiveRankLimit}。如果已有 prior replay buffer，trainer 会按本轮 current examples 的数量抽取 replay examples；buffer 本身最多保留 ${facts.trainer.replayCapacity} 条。`, `The current language-agent adaptation explicitly records paper_equivalent=false, rehearsal_free=false, routing_mode=single_cumulative_adapter, and retention_strategy=bounded_trajectory_replay. Each component has rank ${facts.trainer.rank}, so cumulative effective rank grows with component count; the current Qwen3 path is capped at ${facts.state.effectiveRankLimit}. When a prior replay buffer exists, the trainer samples replay examples to match the current-example count; the buffer itself retains at most ${facts.trainer.replayCapacity} entries.`)}</p>
    <p>{t('因此它复用了 SD-LoRA 的方向/幅度分解思想，但不是 ICLR 2025 vision protocol 的逐项复刻。', 'It therefore reuses SD-LoRA’s direction/magnitude decomposition but is not an item-for-item reproduction of the ICLR 2025 vision protocol.')}</p>
  </details>

  <section class="sdlora__section sdlora__sources" aria-labelledby="sdlora-sources-title">
    <h2 id="sdlora-sources-title">{t('来源与继续阅读', 'Sources and next steps')}</h2>
    <div class="sdlora-sources-grid">
      <div>
        <h3>{t('实现证据', 'Implementation evidence')}</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href={facts.sources.dataset} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={facts.sources.dataset} />{t('Q17 冻结执行：训练数据选择器', 'Q17 frozen execution: training-data selector')}</a></li>
          <li><a href={facts.sources.wrapper} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={facts.sources.wrapper} />{t('Q17 冻结执行：SD-LoRA wrapper', 'Q17 frozen execution: SD-LoRA wrapper')}</a></li>
          <li><a href={facts.sources.capacity} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><ExternalBrandMark href={facts.sources.capacity} />{t('Qwen3-1.7B effective-rank 容量合同', 'Qwen3-1.7B effective-rank capacity contract')}</a></li>
